          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Pricing Log in Sign up Log in Sign up The Inference Cloud built for scale — without complexity or surprise costs. Get Started Explore products Your browser does not support the video tag. Your browser does not support the video tag. Your browser does not support the video tag. Your browser does not support the video tag. Your browser does not support the video tag. Your browser does not support the video tag. Your browser does not support the video tag. Your browser does not support the video tag. Your browser does not support the video tag. Your browser does not support the video tag. Gradient™ AI Inference Cloud Whether you’re training large models, running inference, or creating AI-driven applications, Gradient™ AI enables you to build, deploy, and scale with ease."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Enterprise-grade infrastructure trusted by 600K+ customers running AI inference, serving thousands of requests, and executing every big idea in between. Customers growing with DigitalOcean See how developers and startups around the globe are building and scaling their applications on DigitalOcean while saving money."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "See all customer stories"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "CTO, ScraperAPI"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "The cost of running ScraperAPI would be 250% more on AWS, as compared to DigitalOcean"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Gorkem Yurtseven CTO, fal"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "Empowering the Next Wave of AI Creators with fal and DigitalOcean"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Yury Kamyshenko Head of R&amp;D, Cyprus, Tango"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "It’s not only about the price, it’s also about proving stability, proving a quality level of support and understanding our business. These factors led us to continue to grow on DigitalOcean."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Richard Li Founder &amp; CEO, Amorphous Data"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "Amorphous Data on DigitalOcean GPUs and Kubernetes"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Andres Murcia CTO, Picap"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "We were previously on AWS but started migrating everything because we really love DigitalOcean in terms of cost and support. We saved a lot of money—we went from $120,000 to $30,000 [per month]"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Matt Gray CEO, Servd Hosting"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "How Servd Scaled Their Craft CMS Platform with DigitalOcean Kubernetes"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Travis Beale CTO, Consumable"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "The VIP support has been excellent. If there’s an issue, it’s always engineers on the line, not somebody who is two steps removed from the people that know what’s going on."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Zoltan Bettenbuk CTO, ScraperAPI"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "The cost of running ScraperAPI would be 250% more on AWS, as compared to DigitalOcean"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Gorkem Yurtseven CTO, fal"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "Empowering the Next Wave of AI Creators with fal and DigitalOcean"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Yury Kamyshenko Head of R&amp;D, Cyprus, Tango"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "It’s not only about the price, it’s also about proving stability, proving a quality level of support and understanding our business. These factors led us to continue to grow on DigitalOcean."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Richard Li Founder &amp; CEO, Amorphous Data"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "Amorphous Data on DigitalOcean GPUs and Kubernetes"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Andres Murcia CTO, Picap"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "We were previously on AWS but started migrating everything because we really love DigitalOcean in terms of cost and support. We saved a lot of money—we went from $120,000 to $30,000 [per month]"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Matt Gray CEO, Servd Hosting"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "How Servd Scaled Their Craft CMS Platform with DigitalOcean Kubernetes"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Travis Beale CTO, Consumable"
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "The VIP support has been excellent. If there’s an issue, it’s always engineers on the line, not somebody who is two steps removed from the people that know what’s going on."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Persistent compute, high-throughput storage, scalable runtime environments—everything you need to go from “uhhh” to agent, fast. A unified inference cloud to build full-stack AI apps Train, fine-tune, and run cost-effective inference on infrastructure designed for building, deploying, and scaling high-performance apps and agents."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h2",
            "text": "Stay on budget and grow your business"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "With predictable pricing—plus generous bandwidth and low inference costs—there are never any surprises about what you will pay for our products."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h2",
            "text": "Frustration-free support from real people"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Get free, personalized support or upgrade to paid plans to receive dedicated help and faster response times."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h2",
            "text": "Delight your customers by building on a reliable platform"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Our globally distributed data centers, 99.99% uptime SLAs, and intuitive products help you consistently deliver experiences your customers will love."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h2",
            "text": "Dive in"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Our cloud is built to be simple and powerful, so you can spend your time focusing on building apps, not pulling your hair out."
